      "Language": "spa",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The sixth cranial nerves may be involved in rare cases of post-puncture syndrome after lumbar anesthesia as well as in cases of spontaneous intracranial hypotension. We present 3 cases of spontaneous intracranial hypotension with unilateral or bilateral sixth nerve palsy."},
